#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html.ex:212
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Replies with a quote, threads for longer conversations, reactions and @mentions of people or whole roles. Links get a preview, and you can edit a message too. A link to a form shows the form's title and subtitle to whoever may open it. You can open the chat of a public group, so that those who are not members write there too. You can start a poll right in the chat, and everyone votes from there. A poll says whether unique profiles vote, and whether a shared profile votes once for all who hold it or each of them does. A line shows you where the unread messages begin, the list of groups shows each one's newest message, and a search finds messages, in threads too, even when you type without diacritics, in Latin or in Cyrillic. You can also schedule a message: you pick the time, and it goes out by itself. A message you start and leave waits for you as a draft, an edited one says so, and you can mute a group for a while or until you turn it back on, while mentions still reach you. On a computer, your groups stand in a column beside the chat."
msgstr ""

#: lib/potok_ide_web/live/group_live/show.ex:1503
