#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html.ex:239
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Administrator, All members and roles you make yourself, with 20 permissions: from writing and sending files to creating events and editing the group. A sub-group takes over its parent's roles or has its own. A poll's decision can also give or take a role, a process can put that to the vote, and a group can elect its administrators instead of keeping its founders. You can also ask for a role, when you ask to join a group or as a member, and say why: each role says whether whoever manages requests gives it or a vote decides, and a group can let a vote decide who joins it too. Every member sees who may do what in the group, and why, also for one or more roles picked together; an admin can open the group as those roles would see it, and every change of roles stays on record for all the members. A group keeps its history too: every member sees who changed what and how the group looked on any day, and whoever may change something can put its earlier version back."
msgstr ""

